        "description": "This course will introduce students to the various programmable logic devices (PLDs) available in the market and get them started with how to program such devices to develop simple applications. First half of this course will cover FPGA programming using Verilog and second half will focus on ARM processor programming using C followed by an integration of ARM with FPGA using Zynq board.",
